  "criteria": [
    {
      "id": "ac-1",
      "text": "`runCheck`, `runTry` and `checkRuntimeHealth` resolve the repository root and files through `git` and `files`, authenticate with `gh.exec`, call the PDD interpreter through `http.request`, emit CLI output through `output.stdout` and `output.stderr`, and return `{exitCode}` or `{state, detail, fix}`."
    },
    {
      "id": "ac-2",
      "text": "`readContractHistory`, `savedStoryEvidence`, `createSavedStoryEvidenceReader` (`readSavedStoryEvidence`) and `acquireRuntimeBatchLock` (`releaseBatchLock`) read saved batches and contract snapshots from `files` and manage `SavedStoryEvidenceReader` and `RuntimeBatchLock` handles."
    },
    {
      "id": "ac-3",
      "text": "`acquireCaseWriteOwnership` (`release`), `saveDoorCase`, `saveDoorCaseResult`, `applyPendingCase`, `applyPendingCaseWithHandoff`, `runDoorCall` and `readTryOwner` manage `CaseWriteOwnership` handles, record and apply received Try cases, execute authenticated door calls, and read Try owner metadata."
    },
    {
      "id": "ac-4",
      "text": "Invalid inputs, busy batch locks, unavailable write ownership, and refused door or owner calls raise the declared entry error (`invalid-runtime-input`, `invalid-health-input`, `invalid-history-input`, `invalid-evidence-input`, `invalid-reader-input`, `batch-lock-busy`, `batch-lock-invalid`, `ownership-unavailable`, `invalid-ownership-input`, `invalid-case-input`, `invalid-pending-input`, `door-call-refused`, `door-call-unknown`, `invalid-door-input`, `try-owner-unavailable`, or `invalid-owner-input`)."
    }
  ],
